# Accepted findings for the Trivy security scan (see "Security scanning" in
# infra/README.md). Every entry needs a justification.

# No Docker HEALTHCHECK in either Dockerfile: Azure Container Apps ignores
# Docker HEALTHCHECK and runs its own HTTP probes against the ingress port,
# and the API's distroless base image has no shell to run a check command
# with anyway.
AVD-DS-0026
